# Timbot source material. These files are the grounding corpus and evaluation
# set for the chatbot. They contain employment detail, unpublished context, and
# do-not-answer rules that should never be fetchable at timlabarge.com/timbot/.
# When the chat API function is built, it bundles what it needs via the Vercel
# `includeFiles` config rather than by being served as a static asset.
timbot/
